The image installs a pinned upstream LiteLLM Python release and applies the
AI Alchemy compatibility patches documented in README.md. Those changes cover
ChatGPT subscription request/response compatibility and named Hugging Face
embedding-provider routing. The image does not include WorkOS authentication or
AI Alchemy custom guardrails.

